MODIFICATIONS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This directory is a modified copy of https://github.com/flightportrait/frame
at commit ce3335f. The upstream work is copyright YODE PTE LTD as above; the
changes listed here are copyright 2026 flightframe and are released under the
same Apache-2.0 licence. Files added by those changes carry their own
SPDX-FileCopyrightText header; files modified from upstream are listed below.

Added:

  main/battery.c, main/battery.h
      Battery sense for the Seeed EE02 board: a GPIO load switch drives the
      divider, ten calibrated ADC samples are averaged, and the result is
      reported to the server as an X-Battery-Mv header.

  main/portal.c, main/portal.h
      Wi-Fi provisioning over a captive portal instead of BLE. The frame
      raises an open hotspot, shows a join QR on the panel, serves a
      bilingual form, and writes the provisioning outcome to NVS directly.
      Intended for a frame given to someone who cannot run a laptop tool.

Modified from upstream:

  main/api_client.c, main/api_client.h
      The poster download resumes. It makes up to four attempts per wake,
      each continuing from where the last stalled via an HTTP Range request,
      with a ten-second stall timeout. Added the battery telemetry header.

  main/wifi.c
      Modem power-save is disabled while the radio is up. Some access points
      drop frames buffered for a dozing station, which stalled every bulk
      download while leaving small requests untouched.

  main/app_main.c, main/CMakeLists.txt, main/Kconfig.projbuild
      Wiring for the two additions above, behind CONFIG_FP_WIFI_PORTAL.

  sdkconfig.ee02.defaults
      802.11n frame aggregation disabled, for the same reason as the
      power-save change: one poster per wake makes throughput irrelevant and
      reliability across unfamiliar routers decisive.

  .gitignore
      Per-frame configuration files are excluded. They carry a deployment's
      own server address and provisioning secret and must not be published.
